# GitHub Actions safety

Pin third-party actions to full commit SHAs or existing repo pins.
Do not echo secrets or pass untrusted fork PR inputs to privileged steps.

Use least-privilege `permissions:` blocks. Match existing workflow
patterns for caches, matrices, and environments.
